IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cea-school-attendance`

-- Compulsory Education Act 2000, ss 2, 3, 4, 5(8), 7, 8 and 9 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_compulsory-education-act-2000.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

