#ASSERT `the maximum fine in dollars` `failing to send the child to school` EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in dollars` `refusing a counselling session the Board requires` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `failing to send the child to school` EQUALS 12

